 * returns the full updated payment record; errors result in explicit messages
 * for validation or permission failure.
 *
 * @param props - Request properties
 * @param props.seller - Authenticated seller performing the update
 * @param props.orderId - ID of the associated order for the payment
 * @param props.paymentId - ID of the payment record to be updated
 * @param props.body - Fields to update in the payment record
 * @returns Updated payment record with new field values
 * @throws {Error} If the payment, order, or authorization is invalid
