 * @param props.admin - Authenticated admin user
 * @param props.shoppingMallAiProductOptionId - UUID of the product option to
 *   update
 * @param props.body - Fields to update (name, value, option_sku)
 * @returns The updated product option/variant entity
 * @throws {Error} If product option not found, not authorized, or uniqueness
 *   violation
