 * deleted_at field to the current timestamp. Only the author of the comment
 * (matching seller as customer) can perform this operation.
 *
 * @param props - The request properties
 * @param props.seller - The authenticated seller, must match comment author
 * @param props.bbsPostId - UUID of parent BBS post
