 * audit log record identified by UUID. Only admin-level users may perform this
 * operation. Immutable audit fields (id, entity_type, entity_id, actor_id,
 * actor_role, occurred_at) are never mutated.
 *
 * Throws 404 if no such audit log exists. Strict legal compliance: all updates
