 * shopping_mall_ai_audit_logs).
 *
 * Fetches an individual audit log record by its unique UUID, providing full
 * information about context, affected entity, actor, operation type, and the
 * detailed change description. Strict admin authorization is enforced; only
 * active admins may access this data. All datetime fields are returned as
 * properly formatted strings.
 *
 * @param props -
 * @returns Detailed audit log entry matching IShoppingMallAiAuditLog type
 * @throws {Error} If admin is not found/active or if audit log entry does not
 *   exist
 * @field admin - The authenticated admin user as injected by AdminAuth
