 * may access. Results are paginated and may be filtered by asset type, file ID,
 * and date range.
 *
 * All returned date and ID fields are correctly branded and no intermediate
 * vars are used for Prisma where/orderBy.
 *
 * @param props.admin - The authenticated admin (see AdminPayload)
 * @param props.body - Search/filter DTO for media assets
 * @returns Paginated response including media asset summaries and pagination
 *   meta
