 *   is_active)
 * @param props.cartSessionId - UUID of the cart session to update
 * @param props.body - Update attributes (optional: session_token,
 *   shopping_mall_ai_cart_id, last_active_at)
 * @returns The updated IShoppingMallAiCartSession object
 * @throws {Error} If session does not exist, admin not active, or DB constraint
