/**
 * Retrieves all details of a single product review identified by reviewId, as
 * per shopping_mall_ai_reviews.
 *
 * Returns product, customer, order IDs, rating, comment, timestamps, and
 * deleted_at per spec. Only sellers who own the product for the review can
 * access it, and only if the review is not deleted. Returns 404 if the review
 * does not exist or is soft-deleted; 403 for unauthorized access attempts.
 *
 * @param props - Request parameters
 * @param props.seller - Authenticated seller performing the request
 *   (authorization required)
 * @param props.reviewId - The ID of the review to retrieve
 * @returns IShoppingMallAiReview object with all required fields
