 * ID, current and reserved quantities, optional restock estimate, and last
 * update time. Only inventory associated with products owned by the current
 * seller will be returned; no inventories from other sellers will be exposed.
 * Dates are returned as ISO 8601 strings, nulls handled appropriately.
 *
 * @param props - Request properties
 * @param props.seller - Authenticated seller's payload (must be
 *   active/verified). Only their own inventories will be visible.
