 * roles, and must be used solely to eliminate fraudulent, duplicate, or invalid
 * entries. It performs a hard delete, fully removing the record from the
 * database as permitted by the schema.
 *
 * All deletion actions are audit logged at the compliance layer. Any attempt to
 * delete a non-existent record returns a clearly documented error. Post-delete,
 * the points ledger will not include the deleted event for analytics or audit.
 * The action is irreversible and must be used with caution in real-world
 * deployments.
