 *
 * Retrieve all metadata and record attributes for a single uploaded file by its
 * unique fileId (UUID). The shopping_mall_ai_files table contains core
 * information including upload details, file hash, original file name, file
 * size, media URI, MIME type, and referencing actor (if any).
 *
 * This endpoint enforces authentication and permission checks so only
 * authorized actors (admin, customer, seller, or system auditor) can retrieve
 * sensitive file metadata. For audit or sensitive data, the caller may require
 * role escalation. Soft deletion (deleted_at) is respected. If the file is soft
 * deleted, file metadata will reflect this, and access to the original URI
 * should be blocked in downstream logic.
 *
 * The response exposes all fields except internal implementation artifacts.
 * Error handling provides valid error messages for file not found, unauthorized
 * access, or compliance violations. This endpoint can be used by UI, CDN, or
 * service-level integrations for detailed file reference and access logging.
 *
 * @param props - Request properties
 * @param props.admin - The authenticated admin user making the request
 * @param props.fileId - Unique identifier (UUID) of the file to retrieve
