 * navigation UIs, and offering admin-level reporting. Category records returned
 * contain unique ID, optional parent_id (for hierarchy), category name, display
 * order, active flag, and audit timestamps. Customers are only able to see
 * categories with active=true. Paging is fixed (page 1, limit 100) as no
 * pagination parameters are provided.
 *
 * @param props - Request properties
 * @param props.customer - The authenticated customer making this request
 *   (mandates that only categories for active customers are shown)
 * @returns Paginated product categories data set for the customer (all
