 * to the specified post, or if the seller is not the author. Only the body and
 * updated_at fields are modified.
 *
 * @param props - Request properties
 * @param props.seller - Authenticated seller performing the update
 * @param props.bbsPostId - UUID of the BBS post containing the comment
 * @param props.bbsCommentId - UUID of the comment to update
 * @param props.body - Object containing the new comment body text
 * @returns Updated forum comment record
 * @throws {Error} If the comment is not found, is deleted, does not belong to
 *   the post, or the seller is not the author
