/**
 * Authenticates and verifies an admin user using JWT and database validation.
 * - Verifies the JWT token using jwtAuthorize function.
 * - Ensures payload type is "admin".
 * - Validates admin existence and is_active state in the database.
 * @throws ForbiddenException When payload type is not "admin" or DB validation fails.
 * @param request HTTP request containing headers with Bearer token.
 * @returns Authenticated AdminPayload
 */
